<#ff00ff>Information about Do You Wish mode:</>
World Rejecter moves can only be used in 
Do You Wish mode
Successful uses of World Rejecter will refill
the Do You Wish meter

(Only in Do You Wish Mode)
World Rejecter Counter 					^LP / ^X 

(Only in Do You Wish Mode)
Air World Rejecter Swing 				^LP / ^X (Air)

Kick Throw 					_B / _F  _+ ^LP / ^X
(Can Wall Splat)


Spot Dodge						^LK + ^MK / ^A + ^B 

Slide Dodge						^LK + ^MK / ^A + ^B (in run)

Gauge Charge 						^LK + ^HK / ^A + ^C (Held)

Burst 							^LK + ^MK + ^HK / ^A + ^B + ^C


